      "tr": "Sıfırlarla dolu matris: `[[0] * n for _ in range(n)]`.",
      "en": "A matrix of zeros: `[[0] * n for _ in range(n)]`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Her çift için `matrix[t][p] += 1`.",
      "en": "For each pair `matrix[t][p] += 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef confusion(predicted, truth, n):\n    matrix = [[0] * n for _ in range(n)]\n    for p, t in zip(predicted, truth):\n        matrix[t][p] += 1\n    return matrix\n\ntruth = [0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 2]\npredicted = [0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 0]\nfor row in confusion(predicted, truth, 3):\n    print(row)\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef confusion(predicted, truth, n):\n    matrix = [[0] * n for _ in range(n)]\n    for p, t in zip(predicted, truth):\n        matrix[t][p] += 1\n    return matrix\n\ntruth = [0, 0, 1, 1, 2, 2]\npredicted = [0, 1, 1, 1, 2, 0]\nfor row in confusion(predicted, truth, 3):\n    print(row)\n```"
    }
